WEBVTT

00:28:27.917 --> 00:28:30.726
AG: So you're not just
negotiating with 195 people,

00:28:30.750 --> 00:28:33.976
they're each representing
millions of constituents.

00:28:34.000 --> 00:28:38.393
CF: Yeah, well, they're representing
seven billion people, right, collectively.

00:28:38.417 --> 00:28:41.184
AG: For five years,
Christiana traveled the globe.

00:28:41.208 --> 00:28:43.851
It was one of the most
epic efforts at preparation

00:28:43.875 --> 00:28:46.018
and information exchange ever.

00:28:46.042 --> 00:28:50.518
CF: The challenge here was to find
between what the globe needs

00:28:50.542 --> 00:28:56.726
and what the self-enlighted interest is
of those who are taking decisions.

00:28:56.750 --> 00:28:59.934
If you obligate anyone to choose

00:28:59.958 --> 00:29:04.518
between long-term global need
and short-term interest,